  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "We apply the options on the given equation and solve it using the BODMAS rule:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/b2f64c9f79d77b59f47195df405b394d1389881df31e18c68888ff4c37e1e42e.png] \n\nGiven: 195 × 39 ÷ 3 + 58 - 23 = 50\n\nOption 1) − and ÷\n\n195 × 39 - 3 + __**58 ÷ 23**__ = 50\n\n__**195 × 39**__ - 3 + 2.5 = 50\n\n__**7605**__ - 3 __**+ **____**2.5**__ = 50\n\n__**7607.5 - 3**__ = 50\n\n7604.5 ≠ 50\n\nOption 2) + and ×\n195 + __**39 ÷ 3**__ × 58 - 23 = 50\n\n195 + __13** ×**____** 58**__ - 23 = 50\n\n__**195 + **754__ - 23 = 50\n\n__**949 - 23**__ = 50\n\n926 ≠ 50 \n\nOption 3) ÷ and +\n195 × 39 + __**3 ÷ 58**__ - 23 = 50\n\n__**195 × 39**__ + 0.05 - 23 = 50\n\n__**7605 + 0.05**__ - 23 = 50\n\n__**7605.05 - 23**__ = 50\n\n7582.05 ≠ 50\n\nOption 4) × and ÷\n__**195 ÷ 39**__ × 3 + 58 - 23 = 50\n\n__**5 × 3**__ + 58 - 23 = 50\n\n__**15 + 58**__ - 23 = 50\n\n__**73 - 23**__ = 50 \n\n50 = 50\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"**option (4)\".**",
